abstract: >-
  BIAS is a software application for recording video from
  FLIR IEEE 1394 and USB3 Cameras. BIAS is being developed
  with requirements of experiments in animal behaviors in
  mind, for example recording the behavior of fruit flies in
  walking arenas.
